WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:05.000
On a phone, the menu button at the top opens the full menu.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:11.000
It's the same menu: Overview, Analytics, The Switch, Needs attention, and the rest.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Pick a page, and the menu closes.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:23.000
On a phone, everything stacks into cards you can scroll.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.000
The bottom bar is the quickest way around. Here's Needs attention.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:31.000
One card under another. Tap a card's button to act on it.
